156	   * Card snapshot to stamp when this invoice is created already PAID (renewals,
157	   * auto-charges). Ignored for non-PAID invoices. Null-safe: a user with no saved
158	   * card leaves these null and the UI falls back to their current card fields.
159	   */
160	  paidBrand?: string | null;
