 * NEVER OVER-REFUNDS: the per-month credit is the term-discounted, promo-reduced rate,
 * while every month on the clock was collected at AT LEAST that (renewals charge the
 * full term price with no promo), and `expiresAt` only advances in exchange for
 * payment — so the credit is strictly ≤ what was actually paid for the unused time.
 * Game servers return 0 (they are sold at a flat game-plan price, not the base VPS
 * `planMonthlyCents` this values against, so any non-zero figure could over-refund).
